  "verdict_reason": "R2 resolves the R1 executable-byte authenticity blocker. The profile, schema, fixtures, facade/capture correlations, deterministic transport, error order, lifecycle and generation boundary are coherent and implementable. A strict source-only snapshot replay of both permitted child forms succeeded without reading copied pycache or changing disposable Vault inventory. The child scratch-environment note is a concrete implementation hardening condition, not a contract-shape blocker.",
