      "id": "CHILD_SCRATCH_ENVIRONMENT_IMPLEMENTATION_CONDITION",
      "severity": "implementation_condition",
      "text": "The public inspect implementation internally uses tempfile.TemporaryDirectory. Interpret no caller environment overlays as a fixed child environment and route TMPDIR/TEMP/TMP and HOME to a separate fresh private scratch directory disjoint from upstream/work/vault and from the exact 21-file execution tree. Otherwise inherited TMPDIR could place transient inspect scratch under a caller-selected Vault. This is implementable without API/schema change and should be covered by a hostile-environment regression."
